 "_ghi_chu": "Mo hinh Qwen3-ASR-1.7B (PyTorch, safetensors BF16, can torch va qwen-asr) lam nguoi phan xu cho che do dich (phan_xu.py), chep nguyen ban tu HuggingFace len GitHub Release rieng (workflow qwen-models.yml dang, dung chung tools/publish_asr_models.sh). scripts/lay_asr.py qwen3-asr-1.7b tai tu release truoc, HuggingFace o dung revision duoi la du phong; ca hai deu kiem sha256. model-00001-of-00002.safetensors lon hon 2 GiB nen chia parts (split -b 1500M -d -a 2), lay_asr.py ghep lai roi kiem sha256 file day du. Doi revision: dat release_tag moi, cap nhat revision, size, sha256 tung file theo API HuggingFace, chay thu dau cuoi. Khong xoa hay tao lai release da dang.",
