 "release_notes": "Mo hinh Qwen3-ASR-1.7B lam nguoi phan xu chep loi cho che do dich cua skill video-studio (phan_xu.py), chep nguyen ban (khong sua) tu HuggingFace de tai nhanh va khong phu thuoc huggingface.co.\n\n- Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B @ 7278e1e70fe206f11671096ffdd38061171dd6e5 (Apache-2.0)\n\nTen file: ban (qwen3-asr-1.7b) va ten file goc, noi bang \"--\". model-00001-of-00002.safetensors lon hon 2 GiB (gioi han moi file cua release) nen chia thanh .part00, .part01, .part02; scripts/lay_asr.py ghep lai va kiem sha256 file day du. Ma kiem tra trong SHA256SUMS, khop video-studio/assets/qwen-models.json.\nGiay phep: LICENSE-qwen.txt (Qwen3-ASR, Apache-2.0). Thong tin goc: README-Qwen3-ASR-1.7B.md (the mo hinh nguyen ban).\nKhong xoa hay tao lai release nay: scripts/lay_asr.py tro thang vao ten tag.",
